<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Satyam Dubey's Profile</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #1a0b3b;
    }

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      background: #0a0a0a;
      color: white;
      padding: 14px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .card {
      width: 280px;
      margin: 24px auto;
      background: white;
      border: 2px solid #2f5bea;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
      margin: 0 auto 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #2f5bea;
      color: white;
      font-size: 36px;
      line-height: 90px;
    }

    .bio {
      height: 100px;
      overflow: auto;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #ccd;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .fab {
      position: fixed;
      right: 16px;
      bottom: 16px;
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #d2d0d6;
      font-size: 26px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>My Profile Page</header>

  <main class="card">
    <div class="avatar">S</div>
    <h2>Satyam Dubey</h2>
    <p>B.Tech CSE Student</p>

    <div class="bio">
      Hi! I am Satyam Dubey. I started coding this year. I enjoy making big
      websites, playing BGMI, and listening to music. My goal is to build my
      own app. This is a long bio, so you can scroll inside this box to read
      more about me. I am learning new things every day and hope to create
      useful and exciting projects in the future.
    </div>
  </main>

  <button class="fab" type="button" aria-label="Add">+</button>
</body>
</html>